"The MagiPhysical Education building is Celena North High's cement-block combat training hall."
"Its grounds include the MagiPhys Lawn and the MagiPhys Track with glowing lanes and hurdles."
"The MagiPhys Gym inside was built by Artonans and is unbreakable."
"When the gym is set 'Floor On', its protections block serious harm to anyone connected."
"Pain in the gym feels real but wears off in ten seconds or less."
"Injury realism is set between 40% and 75%, and can go to no reduction at all."
"The gym registers 'kills', colors rank letters by force allowed, and raises light walls."
"Dueling blocks divide the gym floor for one-on-one fights."
"Students wear gray self-sealing bodysuits with red-inlaid metal bands to connect to it."
"The track is unprotected; a boy lost a tooth there."
"A lethal hit must be proven an accident, or the student is expelled from every Apex school."
"Hero-track admission tests, duels and rescue games are held here."
"Each student keeps a personal gray unitard gym suit in the men's or women's locker room."
"Anyone entering while the floor is off must hear 'Floor off!'; no powers are used on it then."
"'The white floor is where we do things that would be fatal elsewhere.'"
"A storage room under the bleachers is a back-up safe zone for emergencies."
"The storage room holds 120-kilo bulletproof sandbags, water bags and lifemass bags for Shapers."
"The B List hides The Beat List, a chart of A-ranks its members beat, behind a poster there."
"A towering scaffold jungle gym is set up for rescue drills with sandbag victims."
"First-year hero PE meets there Monday, Wednesday and Friday for two hours."
"The dueling-block shields can turn opaque, forming a maze of columns and walls."
"Wall cleaning cabinets hold gym suits on headless shiny silver torsos for a cleaning cycle."
"The Earthbox is where Ground Shapers practice."
"A noise barrier divides the bleachers from the gym floor during races."
"Bottlebrush-shaped trees grow outside the MagiPhys building."
"The obstacle course race loops the morphable track, then runs indoor obstacles in the gym."
"Indoor obstacles include a flame-jet shipping container, weight ramps and a rope climb."
"A fifteen-meter magic wall with no handholds and a thirty-foot diving tank end the course."
"Suits simulate injuries in races by stiffening and restricting movement."
"Obstacles can be modified from a tablet at the entrance of each half of the course."
"The MPE building is the campus disaster shelter; Garden Hall residents shelter there."
"Children shelter at the center of the white floor, the most vulnerable spot."
"In the Matadero crisis Vandy Carisson ran a phone-sharing service from a side hall."
"The gym has a transparent ceiling and aerial blocks about twenty feet up."
"Its floor divides into eight large blocks whose barriers can turn opaque and soundproof."
"A black starting line appears on demand; drones can film or not; sod tiles can be laid."
"The storage room holds realistic dummies; the building has a faculty lounge and meeting rooms."
"New classroom desks replaced old tables carved with student names and hero mottos."
